meta {
  name: Register Short Password (400)
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "shortpw@example.com",
    "password": "short",
    "name": "Bruno Tester"
  }
}

docs {
  Expect 400 with details.fieldErrors.password naming the minimum length.

  The rule is length only — there are no composition requirements, per NIST
  SP 800-63B. The iOS sign-up screen reads fieldErrors to put the message
  under the right field.
}
